# Production needs no environment variables or credentials.
# Public testnet configuration lives in packages/perps-adapter/src/config.ts.
# npm run build excludes developer tools. npm run dev / npm run build:qa include them locally.
# Do not deploy the QA build. No VITE_* flag enables tools in a production build.
# Never put private keys, mnemonics, RPC secrets or wallet sessions in VITE_* variables.
# Vite exposes those variables to every browser user.

